// Picket's loadout (openspec/changes/signature-weapons; survey G20, owner, 2026-10-26: "Approve all"). Hand-tuned:
// tools/mechs/gen_mech_data.py writes picket.ron and leaves this file alone. The signature weapon is first and
// starred on the WEAPONS page. Speeds m/s, intervals s, penetration mm, blast MJ, heat a share of the weapon heat
// bank (a shot, or a second of beam), which cools from full in 20 s (survey G23). Starting numbers: playtests tune them.
// The rail rifle: a 1.0 s charge, then a slug at 2 400 m/s that beats any armour, from behind the shield, with the
// scope's window on the front screen at 4 and 10 times (railgun-scope; survey G24).
(
    weapons: [
        (name: "rail rifle", socket: "MUZZLE_R", arm: ArmR, group: 0, speed_m_s: 2400.0, interval_s: 4.0,
         penetration_mm: 400.0, damage: 140.0, blast_mj: 0.0, kind: Slug(charge_s: 1.0), heat: 0.35, signature: true,
         scope_zoom: [4.0, 10.0]),
        (name: "35 mm autocannon", socket: "MUZZLE_L", arm: ArmL, group: 1, speed_m_s: 1100.0, interval_s: 0.12,
         penetration_mm: 90.0, damage: 12.0, blast_mj: 0.4),
        (name: "shoulder missile", socket: "MISSILE_POD", arm: Torso, group: 2, speed_m_s: 260.0, interval_s: 1.2,
         penetration_mm: 150.0, damage: 45.0, blast_mj: 2.5, kind: Rocket, seeker_turn_deg_s: 70.0, rounds: Some(40)),
    ],
    weapon_heat: (recharge_s: 20.0, relight_heat: 0.4),
)
